        "abstract": "Tristan Penman will be talking about his experience implementing a distributed hash table, or DHT, based on the Chord protocol. In particular, the talk will cover some Scala and Akka best practices, and look at how these practices influence the design of a non-trivial actor system.\nTristan is a developer with a background in C++, with recent experience building scalable messaging systems in the telecommunications industry.",
